1
00:01:24,080 --> 00:01:25,440
Why are you drinking tea alone?

2
00:01:26,520 --> 00:01:27,240
Where is your sister-in-law?

3
00:01:27,240 --> 00:01:27,640
She

4
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,240
went out to play golf early in the morning.

5
00:01:35,040 --> 00:01:35,720
Oh.

6
00:01:36,080 --> 00:01:36,480
Hey.

7
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:38,440
What's wrong

8
00:01:38,640 --> 00:01:39,640
with your face?

9
00:01:40,080 --> 00:01:40,800
Ah.

10
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:42,360
It's nothing.

11
00:01:42,720 --> 00:01:43,760
I bumped into something.

12
00:01:43,880 --> 00:01:44,680
Oh,

13
00:01:45,360 --> 00:01:47,520
how can you get a five-finger print?

14
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:47,960
Ah,

15
00:01:49,160 --> 00:01:50,040
it seems that

16
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:51,600
the fiancée of the Lu family

17
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:53,760
is a thorny wild rose.

18
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:54,680
You investigated me?

19
00:01:54,880 --> 00:01:55,680
Oh,

20
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:57,280
I dare not.

21
00:01:57,480 --> 00:01:59,320
Zhuang Wan told me.

22
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:05,920
Oh,

23
00:02:06,320 --> 00:02:07,120
I never thought

24
00:02:07,240 --> 00:02:08,080
I'd see you

25
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:09,440
lose your mind

26
00:02:09,480 --> 00:02:11,520
over a woman in your lifetime.

27
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:12,520
Grandpa,

28
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:14,440
I'll leave if you keep this up.

29
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:15,120
Hey,

30
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:17,520
it's just a slap.

31
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:18,800
What's the big deal?

32
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:20,280
I was even slapped three times

33
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:22,040
when I was pursuing your grandma.

34
00:02:22,320 --> 00:02:23,360
I like Jiang Li

35
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:24,440
very much.

36
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:26,360
She's a bit like your grandma.

37
00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:29,800
Grandpa,

38
00:02:29,880 --> 00:02:30,880
how did you

39
00:02:30,880 --> 00:02:31,960
pursue my grandma?

40
00:02:32,160 --> 00:02:32,960
I...

41
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:34,600
Three words.

42
00:02:35,880 --> 00:02:36,960
Never give up.

43
00:02:37,320 --> 00:02:38,080
and

44
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:39,120
sincerity.

45
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:41,880
Isn't that just pestering?

46
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:45,200
If you really want to be with her,

47
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:49,120
don't try to remove her thorn,

48
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:52,120
but learn to tolerate the pain it causes.

49
00:02:52,920 --> 00:02:53,880
After a long time,

50
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:56,760
it becomes an addiction in your bones.

51
00:02:56,760 --> 00:02:58,040
What if her thorn

52
00:02:58,400 --> 00:02:59,480
is poisonous?

53
00:02:59,920 --> 00:03:01,720
Then learn to be her antidote.

54
00:03:02,480 --> 00:03:03,160
But

55
00:03:03,160 --> 00:03:04,040
I have to remind you that

56
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:05,840
if you really love her,

57
00:03:06,040 --> 00:03:08,840
you should get her out of the quagmire

58
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:09,640
of the Lu family as soon as possible.

59
00:03:09,760 --> 00:03:11,280
I don't allow Zhuang Wan

60
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:12,600
to invest in the Lu family

61
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:13,960
with the capital of the Shen family

62
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:15,840
for a certain reason.

63
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:17,080
What's the reason?

64
00:03:17,920 --> 00:03:20,560
Because Annie is a cobra.

65
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:23,080
Once bitten by it,

66
00:03:23,880 --> 00:03:25,280
there's no cure.

67
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:54,160
Oh,

68
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:56,320
it seems the young master

69
00:03:56,440 --> 00:03:57,840
is more obedient than I thought.

70
00:03:58,080 --> 00:04:00,480
You'd better know some secrets.

71
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:02,160
Your deal with Jiang Li

72
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:03,960
and your love for Lu Qianqian

73
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:05,960
are enough to make me...

74
00:04:05,960 --> 00:04:07,240
Did Li Xiaorou tell you?

75
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:09,520
Can't I find this out myself?

76
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:11,120
Li Xiaorou, you bitch!

77
00:04:11,480 --> 00:04:13,680
Unless you've planted a bug on me!

78
00:04:15,480 --> 00:04:16,320
Come on.

79
00:04:16,760 --> 00:04:17,600
Take a swing.

80
00:04:18,080 --> 00:04:18,960
Not interested.

81
00:04:19,440 --> 00:04:22,200
Negotiation is like the first shot in golf.

82
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:24,080
It's not about the perfect landing,

83
00:04:24,960 --> 00:04:27,240
but about finding the other side's bottom line,

84
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:29,720
so you know your next move.

85
00:04:38,120 --> 00:04:38,720
Tell me.

86
00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:39,520
What do you want?

87
00:04:43,280 --> 00:04:44,360
Shouldn't you ask

88
00:04:45,080 --> 00:04:47,040
what I can offer you?

89
00:04:48,440 --> 00:04:49,280
Then tell me.

90
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:51,080
What can you offer me?

91
00:04:52,320 --> 00:04:54,000
To help you get Lu Qianqian.

92
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:08,320
Nice.

93
00:05:08,960 --> 00:05:10,000
Just like the love

94
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:12,320
hidden in your heart.

95
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:14,560
The force is strong enough.

96
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:15,880
Unfortunately,

97
00:05:15,880 --> 00:05:17,160
you didn't guess the wind direction.

98
00:05:17,760 --> 00:05:18,280
Tell me.

99
00:05:18,360 --> 00:05:19,280
How can you help me?

100
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:21,120
You haven't answered me.

101
00:05:21,440 --> 00:05:22,960
Do you want the golden throne

102
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:24,000
or

103
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:25,720
the girl

104
00:05:26,200 --> 00:05:26,920
you love?

105
00:05:26,960 --> 00:05:28,480
Is there a contradiction?

106
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:31,240
I'm the successor of the Golden Thread.

107
00:05:31,440 --> 00:05:32,680
You seem to be

108
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:34,000
Annie's puppet.

109
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:36,640
You need her approval to hate,

110
00:05:36,760 --> 00:05:38,280
let alone love.

111
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:40,200
I'm telling you,

112
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:42,800
Lu Qianqian is Zhou Jian's woman.

113
00:05:42,840 --> 00:05:44,600
Zhou Jian will be kicked out of the Lu family.

114
00:05:46,880 --> 00:05:47,840
And then?

115
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:51,200
Let Jiang Li take over the company?

116
00:05:51,400 --> 00:05:53,320
She's a woman who's

117
00:05:53,520 --> 00:05:55,440
full of ambition.

118
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:59,880
She's just a tissue to me.

119
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:02,080
I'll throw her away after using her.

120
00:06:02,080 --> 00:06:03,800
It doesn't matter

121
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:05,200
