125
00:06:12,080 --> 00:06:15,240
I can enjoy such a wonderful show.

126
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:16,520
It's not a loss.

127
00:06:19,080 --> 00:06:20,200
Tell me more.

128
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:21,720
I might be interested.

129
00:06:30,080 --> 00:06:31,840
I'll use 5% of Lingshan Electric's

130
00:06:31,880 --> 00:06:34,080
shares under Shen Family's name

131
00:06:34,080 --> 00:06:35,280
