133
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:41,360
And you'll still own 15% of

134
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:43,080
Golden Thread's shares.

135
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:46,040
I just want a say in Golden Thread.

136
00:06:47,520 --> 00:06:50,120
You don't seem like someone who likes losing money.

137
00:06:51,640 --> 00:06:53,320
When trapped animals lick each other's wounds,

138
00:06:53,320 --> 00:06:55,800
who cares if the cage is gilded or not?

139
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:57,040
Besides,

140
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:59,640
it's worth to get a foothold

141
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:01,000
outside the Shen Family.

142
00:07:38,320 --> 00:07:40,640
Dark Fairy Tale Grand Show Countdown seven days.

143
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:43,000
You're as calm as a dead pond.

144
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:45,760
I'm just the one who hands over the knife,

145
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:47,240
but you're the one who holds it.

146
00:07:52,960 --> 00:07:54,520
You're so calm that it's scary.

147
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:56,040
Tell me,

148
00:07:56,360 --> 00:07:57,800
what have you been through?

149
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:01,920
For example, you collude with brother-in-law

150
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:03,280
to eat away at the Lu family's empire.

151
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:07,680
You'd better behave yourself.

152
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:09,480
I feel that Lu Qianqian has been acting strange lately.

153
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:13,480
Ah.

154
00:08:14,640 --> 00:08:15,680
I also feel so.

155
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:16,920
After the wedding,

156
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:19,160
