157
00:08:19,440 --> 00:08:21,320
I guess you haven't been spending enough time with her lately.

158
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:23,960
Only when a woman puts on a wedding dress,

159
00:08:24,320 --> 00:08:25,680
when she wears the wedding dress,

160
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:27,080
she gives her heart to you.

161
00:08:27,640 --> 00:08:28,840
Spend more time with her.

162
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:31,360
She has 15% of the shares,

163
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:33,640
which is the final bonus of Dark Fairy Tale.

164
00:08:36,440 --> 00:08:37,520
You always say

165
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:40,560
The show's success is the first step.

166
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:44,320
What are you planning?

167
00:08:44,560 --> 00:08:46,880
When Pandora's box is opened,

168
00:08:47,920 --> 00:08:50,760
disaster and surprise are always twins.

169
00:08:53,560 --> 00:08:54,400
By the way,

170
00:08:54,800 --> 00:08:56,640
Lu Xu has begun to suspect me recently.

171
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:01,000
If he knows you betrayed him,

172
00:09:02,640 --> 00:09:04,200
he can do anything.

173
00:09:08,080 --> 00:09:10,560
If he hurts me,

174
00:09:10,760 --> 00:09:12,120
will you protect me?

175
00:09:16,040 --> 00:09:17,320
No need to answer.

176
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:18,800
I believe you.

177
00:09:19,040 --> 00:09:20,120
Let's play another round.

178
00:09:42,520 --> 00:09:45,240
Hello, the number you dialed is invalid.

179
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:47,120
Please check and redial.

180
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:53,520
[Hello,]

181
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:56,160
[the number you've dialed is not answered.]

182
00:09:59,280 --> 00:09:59,920
Bitch.

183
00:10:05,520 --> 00:10:06,880
Aren't you on vacation?

184
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:08,440
A long vacation

185
00:10:08,520 --> 00:10:10,080
is just a fancy way of saying you're fired.

186
00:10:10,280 --> 00:10:11,320
Young Master,

187
00:10:12,760 --> 00:10:13,800
just wait for me.

188
00:10:13,800 --> 00:10:14,840
I'll get you back.

189
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:15,760
Are you waiting

190
00:10:15,760 --> 00:10:17,440
for Jiang Li to finish the divorce plan

191
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:18,720
or wait for her to get rid of

192
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:21,000
Zhou Jian, the stumbling block?

193
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:24,000
Who told you that?

194
00:10:24,280 --> 00:10:25,600
Oh, young master,

195
00:10:25,760 --> 00:10:27,520
