196
00:10:27,680 --> 00:10:29,880
She's the ghost of Su Muchen seeking revenge.

197
00:10:30,520 --> 00:10:30,960
Look,

198
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:32,200
what she wants to destroy

199
00:10:32,280 --> 00:10:33,360
is the entire Lu family.

200
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:37,280
Tell me your conditions.

201
00:10:38,760 --> 00:10:39,560
Well,

202
00:10:40,680 --> 00:10:41,680
bring down Jiang Li,

203
00:10:41,800 --> 00:10:44,040
and let me back to the designer position.

204
00:10:45,920 --> 00:10:47,440
Aren't you the Old Madam's man?

205
00:10:47,680 --> 00:10:49,720
Why are you coming to me instead of her?

206
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:52,560
I really didn't get it wrong.

207
00:10:52,560 --> 00:10:54,560
You're really very sharp.

208
00:10:55,560 --> 00:10:57,040
Because I found out some secrets

209
00:10:57,040 --> 00:10:58,600
that I shouldn't have found out.

210
00:10:59,120 --> 00:11:00,480
To protect myself,

211
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:02,240
I have to come to you.

212
00:11:02,400 --> 00:11:03,040
So,

213
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:04,840
I hope that after everything is done,

214
00:11:05,160 --> 00:11:06,320
I can become

215
00:11:06,560 --> 00:11:07,920
your subordinate.

216
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:23,760
You finally came home today.

217
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:28,520
You killed the Lu family with my hand.

218
00:11:29,600 --> 00:11:31,040
How dare you, Jiang Li!

219
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:39,280
What are you laughing at?

220
00:11:39,760 --> 00:11:40,560
Are you afraid

221
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:43,480
Afraid Annie will know you let the wolf in?

222
00:11:44,040 --> 00:11:45,800
I really underestimated you.

223
00:11:45,880 --> 00:11:47,160
How did you know

224
00:11:47,160 --> 00:11:48,360
what happened over 20 years ago?

225
00:11:52,240 --> 00:11:53,840
You Lus are

226
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:56,120
just like scorpions in the desert,

227
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:58,480
only stinging people in the shadows.

228
00:11:59,480 --> 00:12:00,920
Do you think you can

229
00:12:00,920 --> 00:12:02,240
shake the Lu family?

230
00:12:03,040 --> 00:12:04,600
Do you know the bell toad?

231
00:12:05,240 --> 00:12:06,840
The weakest creature

232
00:12:06,880 --> 00:12:09,160
can kill all the fish in a pond.

233
00:12:14,520 --> 00:12:16,440
With Annie as your backing,

234
00:12:16,520 --> 00:12:17,720
you bully those weak people

235
00:12:17,720 --> 00:12:19,160
in the outside world.

236
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:23,760
You hide and shiver in danger.

237
00:12:23,960 --> 00:12:26,080
Do you think Mumu will be more like Zhou Jian

238
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:26,560
or you?

239
00:12:26,760 --> 00:12:27,160
You...

240
00:12:27,760 --> 00:12:29,320
Who are you?

241
00:12:31,440 --> 00:12:33,080
I am a lone wolf in the desert.

242
00:12:33,400 --> 00:12:34,720
But you are not a hunter.

243
00:12:35,480 --> 00:12:36,920
But it doesn't matter.

244
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:40,080
When you do what I want,

245
00:12:41,280 --> 00:12:42,320
you will also get

246
00:12:44,400 --> 00:12:45,640
what you want.

247
00:12:52,360 --> 00:12:53,280
Now,

248
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:55,520
the rules of the game

249
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:57,560
are up to me.

250
00:13:07,560 --> 00:13:08,360
Ah.

251
00:13:35,880 --> 00:13:36,880
What's wrong with your face?

252
00:13:37,320 --> 00:13:38,600
Lu Xu wants to rape Sister Qianqian.

253
00:13:38,760 --> 00:13:39,880
Brother-in-law, stop him.

254
00:13:41,840 --> 00:13:42,640
Liu Yanyan,

255
00:13:43,120 --> 00:13:44,080
take Jiang Li to stop the bleeding.

256
00:13:44,160 --> 00:13:44,800
Aunt Xu, call the police.

257
00:13:44,880 --> 00:13:45,120
Okay.

258
00:13:45,200 --> 00:13:45,440
Okay.

259
00:13:49,400 --> 00:13:50,880
He knows our secret.

260
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:07,720
You bitch.

261
00:14:07,720 --> 00:14:08,800
You tricked me.

262
00:14:14,760 --> 00:14:15,640
Zhou Jian.

263
00:14:15,640 --> 00:14:16,680
Stop, Zhou Jian.

264
00:14:18,960 --> 00:14:20,040
We've all been tricked.

265
00:14:23,280 --> 00:14:24,040
Lu Xu.

266
00:14:38,720 --> 00:14:39,440
Zhou Jian.

267
00:14:39,440 --> 00:14:40,320
Let me explain.

268
00:14:40,760 --> 00:14:41,640
Zhou Jian.

269
00:14:42,040 --> 00:14:43,040
We've all been tricked.
